, a Gorilla Tag-inspired game where fun and movement collide! Explore four unique maps: Spawn for meeting up and hanging out, Forest for fast-paced tag action, Mountains for icy climbing challenges, and the Shop, where you can buy hats, badges, and holdable to customize your capuchin.\n\n\nUse voice chat to connect with friends and players from around the world, and keep an eye out for secret collectibles hidden across the maps.\n\n\nGrab your friends and jump into the wild world of Capu Mania!\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Welcome to Capu Mania, a Gorilla Tag-inspired game where fun and movement collide! Explore four unique maps: Spawn for meeting up and hanging out, Forest for fast-paced tag action, Mountains for icy climbing challenges, and the Shop, where you can buy hats, badges, and holdable to customize your capuchin.\nUse voice chat to connect with friends and players from around the world, and keep an eye out for secret collectibles hidden across the maps.\nGrab your friends and jump into the wild world o"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LRT67QM6ZbSABVHm2ao3avhmtr8FCGpW4lxa4dcDgIw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "WOWGAMES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/capu-mania/home?authuser=3", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "RO